->Free State</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:0.92px;margin-bottom:18px;max-width:600px\">Every town in <!-- -->Free State<!-- --> has access to these ecosystem products. Enter a town to claim an opportunity.</p><div class=\"ecogrid\"><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🔧</div><div class=\"en\">FixEasy24</div><div class=\"ed\">Get verified as a service provider — plumber, electrician, handyman</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/ficksburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🛒</div><div class=\"en\">KasiBuy</div><div class=\"ed\">List your spaza or shop on the local marketplace</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/ficksburg\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">📷</div><div class=\"en\">FrameSouth</div><div class=\"ed\">Become the town&#x27;s photographer — document, prove, earn</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/ficksburg\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">💻</div><div class=\"en\">AI Café</div><div class=\"ed\">Partner to bring AI and internet access to your community</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/phuthaditjhaba\">Available in <!-- -->2<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">📚</div><div class=\"en\">Ubuntu Academy</div><div class=\"ed\">Free CV and job readiness workshops</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎵</div><div class=\"en\">Orbit Music</div><div class=\"ed\">Create music with AI — workshops and tools</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🎙️</div><div class=\"en\">Inside.Town</div><div class=\"ed\">Host a podcast — tell your town&#x27;s story</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"#const\">Browse towns →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🏠</div><div class=\"en\">FamilyHouse</div><div class=\"ed\">Host visitors in your home — earn from hospitality</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/bethlehem\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🌿</div><div class=\"en\">EcoChar</div><div class=\"ed\">5-day charcoal production training — green economy skills</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/bethlehem\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div><div class=\"ecocard\"><div class=\"ei\">🍺</div><div class=\"en\">BuntuBar</div><div class=\"ed\">Mobile bar and beverage workshop — events economy</div><div class=\"eb\"><a href=\"/town/phuthaditjhaba\">Available in <!-- -->3<!-- --> town<!-- -->s<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The model</span><h2 style=\"margin:12px;font-size:1.6px\">One loop runs every town.</h2><div class=\"loopline\" style=\"justify-content:center;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)\">Signal<span class=\"a\">→</span>Workpack<span class=\"a\">→</span>Proof<span class=\"a\">→</span>Memory<span class=\"a\">→</span>Action</div><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:16px auto 0\">As coordinators run the loop, towns render — and the province lights up.</p></section></div><footer class=\"site\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"logo\"><div class=\"mark\">🏘️</div><div><div class=\"wm\" style=\"color:var(--creamhi)\">Ubuntu Town</div><div class=\"tg\">Abantu Bo Buntu</div></div></div><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:12px;max-width:660px\">Illustrative Free State rollout state — town names, regions and districts are real; status, render_pct and potential are demo values until each twin is built. No live twin yet (Free State is the reference build).<!-- --> · light CI · enter.ubuntutown.co.za</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></templa